/-!
# Hyperbolic Arakelov Theory of `Spec ℤ`

Umbrella for the Arakelov geometry of the surface of `Spec ℤ` whose archimedean fibre is `ℍ³` with
the degree geodesic: image distances in Arakelov coordinates; dilation limits of twisted carriers and
the exclusion of carriers of discontinuity, of bounded geometry, along a loxodromic axis and at a
conical end (B118′); the spherical structure of the archimedean compensation and the plastic
crossing; the discriminant diagonal of locked dampings; and the finite places as Bruhat–Tits trees
with the adelic Green formula. See `HyperbolicArakelovTheory/README.md`.
-/
